            </div>
            <p class="case__story">Housekeeping finishes a room, picks up the phone and keys in its status. Minibar items go in the same way, and the charge lands on the guest's folio in Roommaster. If a room phone gets damaged, the IT manager sets up the new one from the management company's San Diego office.</p>
